# Task
Contrast the correct and wrong examples. Produce a DETAILED rule with examples:
- trigger: the condition under which this rule applies ("if/when ...")
- action: what to do / what to avoid ("then ...")
- polarity: positive (do this) | negative (avoid this)
- evidence: one correct and one wrong example illustrating the rule

Be detailed — short rules underperform (ETGPO ablation: -2.22).
